OL,3,GNEWSAMet PC who taunted and hurt
OL,4,Ahomeless man is sacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Metropolitan Police officer who left
OL,7,Fa homeless man requiring hospital
OL,8,Ftreatment after pushing him into a
OL,9,Fbrick wall and throwing him face-first
OL,10,Fon the pavement while calling him an
OL,11,F"idiot" has been sacked.
OL,13,FPC Omer Farok was found to have
OL,14,Fcommitted gross misconduct over his
OL,15,Ftreatment of the vulnerable man in
OL,16,Fcentral London in June 2024.
OL,18,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,19,FConduct (IOPC) said officers had
OL,20,Fattended reports that a man had entered
OL,21,Fan unattended vehicle.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
